# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — meson both_libraries() 无视 default_library 连带构建 .so,依赖静态库非 PIC 时链接必败 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-09-21
# Software: libaudec 0.3.4(任何用 both_libraries 即建共享变体且依赖 conan 非-PIC 静态库的 meson 包)
# Gate: conan create build() / meson compile
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry

id:                     E2384
title: >-
  meson both_libraries() 连带构建共享库，ohpcd 非 PIC 静态依赖链入 .so 报
  R_AARCH64_ABS64 绝对重定位/recompile with -fPIC
trigger_tool: meson / ld.lld
phase: build
error_signature: can not be used when making a shared object|can't create dynamic relocation R_AARCH64_ABS64|recompile with -fPIC|can't create dynamic relocation R_AARCH64_ADR_PREL_PG_HI21
severity:               2
category:               platform, build-system, meson
match_keywords: both_libraries,R_AARCH64_ABS64,shared object,recompile with -fPIC,static_library,default_library,non-PIC,StaticLibraryHolder,get_static_lib
root_cause: >-
  meson 的 both_libraries() 语义是同时构建 static+shared 两个变体，与 default_library
  无关；conan 侧依赖（如 libsamplerate/0.2.2）只发布 shared=False 的静态库且配方未设
  fPIC/CMAKE_POSITION_INDEPENDENT_CODE，产物对象含绝对重定位（实测 src_sinc.c.obj
  31 处 R_AARCH64_ABS64），lld 拒绝把非 PIC 对象链入共享库。在消费侧注入 -fPIC
  只影响本项目对象，救不了预编译依赖——唯一出路是不构建 .so
affected_scope: >-
  OHOS 上全部 meson 包中上游用 both_libraries() 或显式 shared 变体、而依赖是 conan
  非-PIC 静态库的组合；判定与 fPIC 选项名无关，readelf 实测重定位类型才是权威
verification_cmd: cd "$TASK_DIR" && A=$(find "$HOME/.conan2/p" -name libsamplerate.a -not -path "*avr*" 2>/dev/null | head -1) && ar x "$A" src_sinc.c.obj && /data/service/hnp/bin/llvm-readelf -r src_sinc.c.obj | grep -q R_AARCH64_ABS64 && echo NON-PIC-CONFIRMED
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: static-library-patch
rec_description: >-
  patch 把 both_libraries( 改为 static_library(，同步把 meson.build 与
  tests/meson.build 里的 audec.get_static_lib () 调用改为直接引用该 static_library
  对象
rec_command: patch -p1 < patches/0001-<name>-static-library.patch
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: >-
  conandata.yml 登记 patch_file + patch_type=portability，conanfile 用
  apply_conandata_patches 应用；options 收敛为 shared=[False]（R26 静态交付）
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: rebuild-deps-with-pic
fallback_description: >-
  从源头重建带 fPIC 的依赖（改上游依赖配方加 fPIC 选项）再支持共享变体；代价是动
  他人已发布包，通常不值得
fallback_command: (无通用命令——需修改依赖包配方并在 ohpcd 重发)
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl: 仅当消费侧确实需要 .so 时考虑
principles:               
conflicts_with:
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-E644-meson-both-libraries-nonpic-static-dep.md
last_updated: 2026-09-21
source_event: >-
  libaudec 0.3.4 OHOS 采信轮 G2 失败——先报 Unknown method "get_static_lib"
  （漏改 tests/meson.build），再回溯根因为 both_libraries() 连带 .so 与非 PIC 依赖
  冲突；以 llvm-readelf -r 实测 src_sinc.c.obj 31 处 R_AARCH64_ABS64 定案
authors: Awstme
source_pr: (本 PR)
source_commit: 1ec1f3408f2167c230ba3dfdd6f0757d348a494a
metrics_success_count: 1
metrics_fail_count: 0
metrics_confidence: 0.95
metrics_last_used: 2026-09-21
